        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:1.0625rem; line-height:1.85;"><strong>Client intake and administrative work eat into billable hours.</strong> Automating client triage, document drafting, and time entry gives fee-earners back hours that would otherwise go to paperwork instead of casework.</p>
