        <p style="color:#42474e; font-size:1.0625rem; line-height:1.85;">That includes documenting how the system flags clauses and citations in terms your risk and compliance partners can defend, not just code your engineers can read. It takes longer to start this way, and it's the reason the systems we hand over get used instead of quietly abandoned.</p>
